@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Baseline: all products
GET {{base}}/products

### T1 price filter -> 4 products (Wool Scarf, Clean Code, JavaScript Basics, Node.js Handbook)
GET {{base}}/products?min=300&max=1000

### T1 invalid -> 400
GET {{base}}/products?min=abc

### T1 min > max -> 400
GET {{base}}/products?min=500&max=100

### T2 sort -> iPhone 17, iPhone 15, Budget Phone
GET {{base}}/products?sort=price_desc&limit=3

### T2 SQL injection attempt -> 400
GET {{base}}/products?sort=price;DROP TABLE products

### T3 pagination
GET {{base}}/products?sort=name&page=2&limit=5

### T3 limit too big -> 400
GET {{base}}/products?limit=50

### T4 count -> { "total": 12 }
GET {{base}}/products/count

### T6 stats
GET {{base}}/products/stats

### T5 categories
GET {{base}}/categories

### T5 products in "Books" (id 3) -> 4 products
GET {{base}}/categories/3/products

### T5 missing category -> 404
GET {{base}}/categories/99/products

### Soft delete product 8, then count -> 11
DELETE {{base}}/products/8

